{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56411","headline":"大丹歌 · 裴相公","name":"大丹歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道留丹灶，清心慕烟霞。\n阴阳成造化，水火结河车。\n铅汞须归戊，炉开紫金花。\n华池再修育，神水各爲家。\n志士得之须保惜，定我性命育神室。\n下士闻之多暗笑，真人见说安魂魄。\n焚香礼之万事毕，皆感天地作仙质。\n（《正统道藏》本《大丹篇》。\n）（按：《大丹篇》作者不详。\n大致可确定爲宋或宋以前人之作。\n宋时无裴姓入相者，因知爲唐人之作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴相公","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}